ES:
¡Chist!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} ¡Venga,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} que ya es casi
la hora de dar la bienvenida
al año nuevo!{{TAG:0007:0008:1E000000}}

{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Esto...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Tenemos un problemilla.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
¡Llevas los bolsillos hasta arriba!
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Avísame cuando tengas hueco, anda.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Hey kuzen,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} bir sorunun var.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Üzerinde fazla eşya taşıyorsun.
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Biraz yer açıp tekrar gelsene!

ES:
Todas las galletas tienen
un papel de la fortuna dentro.
¡Y solo cuestan {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0004:0008:0000}} bayas{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¿Te apetece probar suerte?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
¡Dame una!
Paso...

IT:
Premi strabilianti con i biscotti
lotteriaaa! Non lasciateveli sfuggire!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Costano la modica cifra di {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0004:0008:0000}}
stelline {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}l'uno! Ti interessano?
Ma che domande: certo che sì!{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Ne prendo uno!
Invece no.

DE:
Mit Lotteriekeksen veeerrückte
Preise gewinnen!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Nur {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0004:0008:0000}} Sternis{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Möchtest du einen haben?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Ja bitte!
Nein danke.

TRANSLATION:
Hey, kusura bakma!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Daha
açılmadık kuzen!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Havai Fişek Gösterisi{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} başlayınca{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
açıyoruz. Biraz sabret!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Lo siento, prim{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Cerrado. {{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Abrimos la semana que viene,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¡no faltes! Asegúrate de llegar
prontito e irte tarde.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Üzgünüm dostum!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Çoktan kapattık!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Gelecek yılın ilk {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Havai Fişek
Gösterisine{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} kadar beklemen gerekecek!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Anladım!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}Değiştireceğin {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}bileti{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
bana ver.
Hadi ihtiyar {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Redd{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}'e uzat kuzen!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}Oggi non è il tuo giorno fortunato{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0013:}}Non è un biglietto vincente, ma
ho qualcosina per te comunque...
